{
 "batchId": "b-0321",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_fe2fa546990f923d8e03",
   "sourceHash": "fe2fa546990f923d8e039d4a3d66139bffad92840bf9c30ad287921f72de8066",
   "text": "二十天分为四个阶段：基础知识与 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）；逐一学习各项经典疗法；Panchakarma、药物与饮食学；问诊实践、职业礼仪与考试。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e09a351c2df8257086f0",
   "sourceHash": "e09a351c2df8257086f0046a006635ac07cf40d82a804af4af2e2dee74672b38",
   "text": "第1–5天——基础知识与 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）：概论、历史与分科；Panchamahabhuta、Tridosha、Saptadhatu、Agni 与 Ama；健康与疾病；从头颈部到全身学习 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）；Shirodhara（希罗达拉）与 Nasyam 的理论与实操。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_93710ed2f7c3090cba13",
   "sourceHash": "93710ed2f7c3090cba13e710758ccf41bd6c9591969e19eea74053e83a23592b",
   "text": "第6–10天——深入学习各项疗法：Dhatu、Mala、Agni 与 Ama 以及疾病分类；Dinacharya 与 Ritucharya；人体解剖学与生理学；Podikizhi、Udwarthanam、Udhgarshanam 与 Kativasti；Roga 与 Rogi Pareeksha；Prakriti 的定义、分析问卷及体质分析。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d0f7ad2b7f2d56ab14a9",
   "sourceHash": "d0f7ad2b7f2d56ab14a9d5b33a1d9ed96521ad26bd15d3e36959f9f9501d88f0",
   "text": "第11–15天——饮食学、药物与 Panchakarma：Ahara 与 Vihara，Dravyaguna 及物质的作用（Guna、Virya、Vipaka、Prabhava）；经典药物与专有药物，并进行产品演示；Snehanam 与 Swedanam、Poorva 与 Pashchat Karma、Vamanam、Virechanam、Nasyam、Vasti 与 Raktamoksha，以及各自的注意事项和禁忌症；Njavara Kizhi（基兹）与 Elakizhi 的制备与施用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c793348b1cee1297b7b5",
   "sourceHash": "c793348b1cee1297b7b5cf94751796ab3a759a9e948a628489d5fcafbe1d4bff",
   "text": "第16–19天——问诊与实践：Nadee Pareeksha 与生命体征测量；阿育吠陀健康问诊、体质分析及项目制定，并准备病例档案；理论与实操全面复习；疗法礼仪、治疗室与器械托盘准备、蒸汽发生器与药房操作、法定要求以及阿育吠陀监管机构。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5db7898b99c577d2ed71",
   "sourceHash": "5db7898b99c577d2ed714ae567f96afd84e45a060c81bdd8f5277e7199cc5bb9",
   "text": "第20天——考试：一份客观题理论试卷和一场实操考试，随后是结业课程与颁发证书。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_078bebf20846acb49157",
   "sourceHash": "078bebf20846acb49157cf0b8aaabe2787ac0dca4e5517488fe97fb98bdc09ce",
   "text": "形式：二十天共八十学时——每天均有理论与实操——课程结束时进行考试。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_be41a55a99b48b719c5e",
   "sourceHash": "be41a55a99b48b719c5e293d25742cfdfc94db43136f8ad20c3b75718ba49b35",
   "text": "适合人群：希望获得认可的从业者证书的医疗保健与健康行业人士、生活方式顾问及治疗师。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cfad79f28e64c9b9a42d",
   "sourceHash": "cfad79f28e64c9b9a42d94927d8fe68ac8fc24b00060dc663fbcc3e7fb593c1a",
   "text": "课程结束后：合格学员可参与 Kairali 国内及国际中心的项目与实践工作；表现优异的学员可能被考虑担任阿育吠陀健康顾问职位。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_18f5ff0555945f1d16e4",
   "sourceHash": "18f5ff0555945f1d16e42cd9c4493db1d708457e28e299daa724b8e29ce18de7",
   "text": "住宿：在医院别墅入住二十晚，按培训价格每晚计费——豪华别墅（Deluxe Villa）单人 ₹18,410 / 双人 ₹30,530（$263 / $436；€230 / €382）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "t_18f5ff0555945f1d16e4 banned-term 豪华"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d6bd0ceef589dcfdc5fe",
   "sourceHash": "d6bd0ceef589dcfdc5fecaf5c572296642dc19d6cbeddec94def37e7ae065e86",
   "text": "八项疗法：按医院标准施行 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉）、Nasyam、Podikizhi、Udwarthanam、Kativasti、Njavara Kizhi（基兹）与 Elakizhi。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c7a388cc692a18f09076",
   "sourceHash": "c7a388cc692a18f0907681bc11035b4c2f02ac4d42915e17ab09809713cb8fd1",
   "text": "问诊：为患者进行检查（Roga 与 Rogi Pareeksha、Nadee Pareeksha），分析体质，并结合病例档案制定项目。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2858598ae94841ac4d8e",
   "sourceHash": "2858598ae94841ac4d8e30b4bb219dcc27134897473c3fd49271595c8269db23",
   "text": "Panchakarma：讲解 Panchakarma 的两个方面、五项操作及其注意事项。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cc14e698fa68c10c98f5",
   "sourceHash": "cc14e698fa68c10c98f5f6aa8b8059513e1e66eb1429230237061f78bc349307",
   "text": "饮食学与药物：运用 Dravyaguna 与 Ahara–Vihara 原则，并了解经典制剂与专有制剂。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a47fcb5863852cbc86ca",
   "sourceHash": "a47fcb5863852cbc86ca0e4beae407933ad7dba67ccb3707a2611f190fc3ba3a",
   "text": "职业实践：按照医院礼仪管理治疗室，并了解阿育吠陀的法定框架。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c50c2b209e777a1ccfd1",
   "sourceHash": "c50c2b209e777a1ccfd16c9b9c078333674e178f7fac4131f6cd23144bbd66f4",
   "text": "医疗保健专业人员、健康顾问与治疗师，以及寻求从业者级别培训的认真学习阿育吠陀的学生。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7088044f8e345ae06591",
   "sourceHash": "7088044f8e345ae0659138fedbbb00ccf34b0672982cea2cc7ff188f4627837e",
   "text": "我需要事先接受过阿育吠陀培训吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
